
  <sn><md>### Mollisols {.text-center}

:::.row
:::.col-12 .col-md-9
**Concept:**

- Latin word ++mollis++ means `soft`. 
- This order includes most `important agricultural soils` and is characterized by `dark colored`, base rich (&gt;50%), `well-structured surface` horizon known as `mollic epipedon`. 
- The vast majority of Mollisols are formed in base rich parent material `under grassland vegetation`.
